@HostAddress = http://localhost:5208

### 0.1 Login como SuperAdmin (Gera Token JWT)
# @name login
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@tournament.local",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### 0.2 Obter Perfil do Usuário Logado
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### 0.2.1 Criar Convite de Cadastro para Email
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/invitations
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jogador1@dota.local",
  "targetRole": 0
}

### 0.2.2 Listar Todos os Convites Enviados (Para ver emails, códigos gerados e status)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/invitations
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Accept: application/json

### 0.2.3 Desativar/Revogar Convite (Cancela o link antes de ser usado)
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/invitations/{{$guid}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### 0.3 Atualizar Funções (Roles) do Jogador e Função Favorita
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roles": ["Carry", "Mid", "Offlane", "SoftSupport", "HardSupport"],
  "preferredRole": "Mid"
}

### 0.4 Vincular Conta Steam (OpenDota Profile)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/link-steam
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "steamId": 76561198000000001
}

### 0.5 Solicitar Recuperação de Senha (Esqueci a Senha - Anti-Enumeração)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@tournament.local"
}

### 0.6 Redefinir Senha (com Token e Confirmação de Senha)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "TOKEN_RECEBIDO_AQUI",
  "newPassword": "NovaSenhaForte123!",
  "confirmPassword": "NovaSenhaForte123!"
}

### 0.7 Solicitar Recuperação de Login (Esqueci o Login/Username)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/forgot-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@tournament.local"
}

### 0.8 Consultar Login Recuperado
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/recover-login?token=TOKEN_RECEBIDO_AQUI
Accept: application/json

### 0.9 Caixa do Admin: Listar Solicitações de Recuperação Geradas
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/recovery-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Accept: application/json


### 0.99 Listar Todos os Torneios (com filtro opcional de status)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tournaments
Accept: application/json

### 1. Obter opções de configuração gerais (sem filtro de time)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tournaments/options
Accept: application/json

### 2. Obter formatos válidos para 5 equipes (deve retornar apenas Fase de Grupos)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tournaments/options?teamCount=5
Accept: application/json

### 3. Obter formatos válidos para 8 equipes (retorna Mata-Mata e Grupos com opção de 2 grupos)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tournaments/options?teamCount=8
Accept: application/json

### 4. Criar Torneio
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tournaments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Copa Internacional Dota 2",
  "type": "DirectPlayoffs",
  "playoffFormat": "SingleElimination",
  "teamCount": 4,
  "groupCount": 1,
  "playoffSeriesFormat": "Bo3",
  "grandFinalSeriesFormat": "Bo5",
  "enableDraftMode": true
}

### 4.1 Encerrar Inscrições do Torneio (Libera início do Draft)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tournaments/{{$guid}}/registrations/close
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 4.2 Convidar/Inserir Jogador Atrasado de Fora Durante o Draft
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/draft/{{$guid}}/late-players
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Miracle-",
  "externalUserId": "steam-76561198000000099",
  "roles": ["Carry", "Mid"],
  "preferredRole": "Mid",
  "rankTier": 80,
  "avatarUrl": "https://avatars.steamstatic.com/sample.jpg"
}

### 5. Renomear Equipe após Conclusão do Draft (Apenas Admin)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/draft/{{$guid}}/teams/{{$guid}}/rename
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newName": "Team Liquid",
  "expectedVersion": 25
}

### 6. Consultar Tabela de Classificação do Torneio (Standings com Desempates e Versão)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tournaments/{{$guid}}/standings
Accept: application/json

### 7. Iniciar Torneio (Gera partidas de Grupos ou Chaveamento de Playoffs)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tournaments/{{$guid}}/start
Content-Type: application/json

### 8. Avançar para os Playoffs (Calcula seeds dos Grupos e monta chaveamento)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tournaments/{{$guid}}/playoffs/generate
Content-Type: application/json

### 9. Reverter para Fase de Grupos (Trava de segurança: só se 0 jogos nos playoffs)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tournaments/{{$guid}}/playoffs/revert
Content-Type: application/json

### 10. Lançar W.O. (Walkover) da Série Inteira (Admin)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/matches/{{$guid}}/result/walkover
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "winnerTeamId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001"
}

### 11. Ingestão de Replay (.dem Parser)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/matches/result/replay-ingest
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "matchSeriesId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "gameNumber": 1,
  "winnerTeamId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "durationSeconds": 2650,
  "teamAKills": 42,
  "teamBKills": 18,
  "dotaMatchId": 7891234567,
  "playerStats": [
    {
      "playerId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000010",
      "teamId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
      "heroId": 1,
      "kills": 15,
      "deaths": 2,
      "assists": 18,
      "netWorth": 28000,
      "goldPerMinute": 780,
      "experiencePerMinute": 850,
      "itemIds": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]
    }
  ]
}

### 12. Desfazer Apenas o Último Mapa da Série (Preserva jogos anteriores)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/matches/{{$guid}}/games/remove-last
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 13. Aplicar W.O. em Mapa Específico (Jogo #1)
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/matches/{{$guid}}/games/1/walkover
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "winnerTeamId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001"
}

### 14. Reverter a Série Inteira (Zera para 0x0)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/matches/{{$guid}}/rollback
Content-Type: application/json

### 15. Upload de Replay (.dem) processado via ParseGoDota CLI
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/matches/{{$guid}}/upload-replay
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="replayFile"; filename="8817940931.dem"
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

< ./tools/ParseGoDota/replays/sample.dem
--WebAppBoundary--

### 16. Inserir Resultado Manual da Série (Próximo Mapa)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/matches/{{$guid}}/result/manual
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "winnerTeamId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "durationSeconds": 2100,
  "teamAKills": 35,
  "teamBKills": 22,
  "firstPickTeamId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "teamABanHeroIds": [1, 2, 3],
  "teamBBanHeroIds": [4, 5, 6],
  "dotaMatchId": 8817940931
}

### 17. Atualizar/Editar Resultado Manual de Mapa Específico (Jogo #1)
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/matches/{{$guid}}/games/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "winnerTeamId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "durationSeconds": 2300,
  "teamAKills": 20,
  "teamBKills": 40,
  "firstPickTeamId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "teamABanHeroIds": [1, 2, 3],
  "teamBBanHeroIds": [4, 5, 6],
  "dotaMatchId": 8817940931
}

